  "limitations": [
    "After candidate 8d97e24 hit the unchanged backend quality deadline, the user separately approved bounded per-registry schema-structure validation reuse and freshness/security regressions. Candidate 8d97e24 remains preserved on codex/ac-18-checkpoint-8d97e24. This approval neither waives the timeout nor guarantees that the optimization will meet it; the revised frozen candidate must rerun all full qualification.",
    "AC-18 is a new, narrowly scoped user-requested diagnostic port on current main, not a second AC-15 implementation or merge. Original AC-15 evidence, its retained requirement branch, the historical diagnostic branch and all checkpoints remain unchanged. No protected evidence policy, schema or executor changes are authorized.",
    "Read diagnostics are supplementary telemetry. The existing authoritative counters and rejection rules decide acceptance; detailed bins may only make malformed evidence fail. Counter conservation is not proof that a memory snapshot matches the kernel's later read, and raw helper errno values are not retained.",
    "The VMA runner is diagnostics-only and native ARM64-only. Completion is distinct from acceptance and does not replace any complete suite. It does not qualify a QEMU-emulated target, enabled or unknown kernel naming configuration, arbitrary memory races or an adversarial Docker administrator.",
    "Acquisition of the source-bound image is an explicit prior network-enabled step, not a verification fallback. Verification never installs, builds or pulls the AC-15 image. Runtime targets and collector keep their existing capabilities, namespace, network, seccomp, image/source binding and owned cleanup requirements.",
    "The four original AC-15 suites retain their existing inventory and optional PostgreSQL semantics. Their optional skips do not qualify PostgreSQL. The separate current clean-state journey includes its required PostgreSQL tests, and both Compose recovery gates remain mandatory; no new host-native PostgreSQL qualification is claimed.",
    "Full observed execution remains pending until the frozen candidate passes every required gate. Historical reports, focused passes, diagnostic completion and the unsigned local source-consistency record are not independently authenticated execution or complete-release acceptance.",
    "CI stays disabled, not green. No checkpoint, historical branch or main rewrite, publication or main merge is authorized by this manifest. Ask for explicit publication and non-fast-forward merge approval only after full verification. Keep sanitized reports outside Git and never publish backup/key bundles or credentials."
  ]
